<title>JAPAN: NTT sharply lower after Friday's surge.</title>
<headline>NTT sharply lower after Friday's surge.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp (NTT) fell sharply on Monday morning having been lifted to a new high for the calendar year by Friday's close by somewhat speculative buying, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0041 GMT, the share was down 50,000 yen at 1.06 million yen after being ask-only. It was the third largest percentage loser on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
